-GRN250\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-grn250\", \"category\": \"outdoor\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-grn250.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 600, \"highPrice\": 5000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-grn250\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"5,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"240 x 240 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta65,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the GreenScreen Outdoor 2.5mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The GreenScreen Outdoor features a 2.5mm pixel pitch, providing crisp and clear images with excellent detail, ideal for outdoor applications where viewers are close to the display.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display, and is it suitable for direct sunlight?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 5,000 nits, the display is highly visible even under direct sunlight, making it perfect for outdoor environments that require 